<% layout("/layouts/boilerplate") %>

<div class="row  mt-3">
    <div>
        <h3>Overview</h3>
        <p>
            FarmerHub is a dedicated platform designed to address the daily labor needs of farmers.
            It connects farmers with workers efficiently and seamlessly, ensuring that farming tasks
            are completed on time with the right workforce.
        </p>
    </div>
    <hr>
    <div>
        <h3>Features</h3> <br>
        <div>
            <p><b>1. User Authentication and Authorization</b></p>
            <ul>
                <li>Secure login and sign-up options for both farmers and workers.</li>
                <li>Role-based access to functionalities (e.g., workers can only apply for jobs after logging in).</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
            <p><b>2. Task Posting</b></p>
            Farmers can post detailed descriptions of their tasks, including : <br>
            <ul>
                <li>What types of work in farm.</li>
                <li>Description about the work.</li>
                <li>Number of workers needed.</li>
                <li>Salary per worker.</li>
                <li>Task images.</li>
                <li>Location details with exact coordinates for easy navigation.</li>
                <li>Duration of the task in hours.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
            <p><b>3. Task Visibility</b></p>
            <ul>
                <li>All users, including non-registered visitors, can view posted tasks.</li>
                <li>Workers must log in to apply for tasks.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
            <p><b>4. Application Process</b></p>
            <ul>
                <li>Workers can apply for tasks by filling out a form with their basic details (name, mobile number, address).</li>
                <li>Farmers can view applications and contact workers directly.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
            <p><b>5. Task Management</b></p>
            <ul>
                <li>Farmers can edit or delete their task posts if there are errors or if the task is no longer available.</li>
                <li>Once the required workers are found, farmers can remove the task post from the portal.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
            <p><b>6. Geolocation Services</b></p>
            <ul>
                <li>Accurate location details of the work site provided to assist workers in reaching the farmer’s house without hassle.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
    <hr>
    <div >
        <h3>Usage</h3> <br>
        <div>
            <h5>For Farmers :</h5> <br>
            <p><b>1. Sign Up / Login :</b></p>
            <ul>
                <li>Create an account or log in to an existing account to access full features.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
            <p><b>2. Post a Task:</b></p>
            <ul>
                <li>Navigate to the 'Add New Work' section.</li>
                <li>Fill in all required details such as number of workers, salary, task duration, and location.</li>
                <li>Submit the task post.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
            <p><b>3. Manage Tasks :</b></p>
            <ul>
                <li>Edit or delete existing posts if needed.</li>
                <li>Remove posts once the required number of workers is hired.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
            <p><b>4. View Applications :</b></p>
            <ul>
                <li>Check the applications submitted by workers.</li>
                <li>Contact suitable candidates directly to finalize hiring.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
            <h5>For Workers :</h5> <br>
            <p><b>1. Sign Up / Login :</b></p>
            <ul>
                <li>Create an account or log in to apply for tasks.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
            <p><b>2. Browse Tasks :</b></p>
            <ul>
                <li>View all available tasks without logging in.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
            <p><b>3. Apply for Tasks :</b></p>
            <ul>
                <li>Log in to apply for a task.</li>
                <li>Choose tasks based on proximity and suitability.</li>
                <li>Fill in basic details and submit the application.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
            <p><b>4. Communication :</b></p>
            <ul>
                <li>Wait for the farmer to contact you if your application is shortlisted.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
    <hr>
    <p>Thank you for using FarmerHub to streamline your farming labor needs!</p>
</div>